      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been on sertraline for like 2 years now and it works great for my depression but i really messed up my back lifting stuff at work. my doctor prescribed some tramadol for the pain but i wanted to check with u first if it's okay to take them together? i dont want to mess anything up",
