      "content": "i know you cant give official advice but i'm just really panicking here. i really need the pain relief so i can sleep. if i do take it and i start feeling a bit jittery or sweaty, is that just the pain or something serious? help me out here, just a general idea of what's normal vs what's not so i don't end up in the er unnecessarily.",
